<title>USA: Oneida sets special cash dividend.</title>
<headline>Oneida sets special cash dividend.</headline>
<dateline>ONEIDA, N.Y. 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oneida Ltd said Wednesday its board of directors had declared a special cash dividend of $0.13 per share, to be paid in addition to the regular fourth quarter dividend of $0.13.  </p>
<p>The company said the special dividend reflected its &quot;solid&quot; results for the 1996 fiscal year, which ended January 25, 1997. It was also intended to reflect some of the gain the company will receive from the February 12, 1997 sale of its Camden Wire subsidiary, it said.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
